Endpoints

GET /:region/summoner/:gameName/:tagLine
Returns: SummonerProfileResponse

GET /:region/summoner/:gameName/:tagLine/matches?count=20&queue=solo        //You can use this without the ?count or ?queue or with just one of those
Returns: MatchHistoryResponse

GET /:region/summoner/:gameName/:tagLine/champions
Returns: ChampionStatsResponse

GET /:region/summoner/:gameName/:tagLine/ranked
Returns: RankedResponse

Supported queues: Normal Draft (400), Ranked Solo/Duo (420), Ranked Flex (440)
Default count: 20, max: 50

Supported regions: euw, eune, na, br, lan, las, kr, jp, tr, ru, oce, ph, sg, th, tw, vn